% B2-BIGDATA: DATA LARGER THAN THE DEMAND-ZERO ISD AFTER THE DATA ISD.
% TYPED AT THE CONSOLE, SO THAT IMAGE DOES NOT SAVE A LOAD LEVEL (SEE C1).
% ISD 1 + ISD 2 IS 7B PAGES (F600 BYTES).  FIX_DZRO (IMAGE:79) SUBTRACTS
% THE GROWTH FROM ISD 2'S PAGE COUNT WITHOUT A CHECK.  AN ARRAY OF 4000
% LONGWORDS ADDS 10000 BYTES.
'IMGUTIL.STO LOAD
HEX
4000 'BIG ARRAY
12345678 BIG FFFC + !
"BIG LAST=" MSG BIG FFFC + @ <#> TYPE CR
PTRS
'B2.TMP IMAGE
IORB<<
HINFO SHOW
>
DECIMAL
